      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SYSTEM PREREQUISITES\n\n• OCI IAM read access is scoped to the intended tenancy, compartments, and telemetry resources.\n• Signal collection, retention, clocks, and the investigation time window are validated before querying.\n• Resource ownership and escalation routes are mapped before an operational action is assigned.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SYSTEM PREREQUISITES\n\n• OCI IAM read access is scoped to the intended tenancy, compartments, and telemetry resources.\n• Signal collection, retention, clocks, and the investigation time window are validated before querying.\n• Resource ownership and escalation routes are mapped before an operational action is assigned.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
